{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20268KF7TiUMcD1795588438.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>《審計報告》指消委會，處理投訴及查詢的時間不達標，最長一宗處理了近三年半。</p><p></p><p>市民及旅客遇到不良商戶，可找消費會投訴。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"J.AUDIT.CONSUMER-1300-1_CLEAN_2.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026nFTgFzzFCQ1795588433.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>新一份《審計報告》就發現，消委會處理投訴的時間不理想。過去五年接獲17.4萬投訴，有8.7萬已結案可跟進投訴。但有百分之8、即近7,000宗，不達消委會訂立的目標，即處理逾4個月以上。當中近三分一更用逾半年處理，最長一宗用了三年四個月。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"J.AUDIT.CONSUMER-1300-1_CLEAN_3.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026yuDqT49GWd1795588428.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>另外，若有商戶貨品或服務質素差劣，屢遭人投訴，消委會設觀察名單。截至6月底，消委會共有28個商戶在名單上。但消委會無紀錄何時將商戶列入名單，部分亦無列明何時採取行動。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"J.AUDIT.CONSUMER-1300-1_CLEAN_4.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Bh52l0BTqw1795588426.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>審計署又發現，有紀錄行動的13個商戶，七成七在一年半內再有新投訴，但消委會無跟進行動。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"J.AUDIT.CONSUMER-1300-1_CLEAN_5.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026QJ8hLWe3HN1795588423.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>除了解決市民的投訴，消委會亦不時抽查市面產品。但《審計報告》發現，其中十項在2024年9月至今年6月的調查，有兩項測試無向商戶披露法規，測試標準等。近1,200項、涉款14萬元的樣本，無紀錄測試完如何處理，只是指由實驗室處置。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"J.AUDIT.CONSUMER-1300-1_CLEAN_6.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026BqYBELl2Se1795588419.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>署方又指消委會部分開支不明。包括有11宗申領餐費，超過人均開支上限的450元，最高一宗人均花費近1,500元。亦有一次款待，是由10名消委員會員工對3名賓客，亦無清楚列明理據。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"J.AUDIT.CONSUMER-1300-1_CLEAN_7.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026gfhxamROYB1795588417.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>審計署建議消委會採取有效措施，確保處理投訴及查詢的服務表現要達標。應追討多發放的膳宿津貼，並採取措施確保準確計算，並恪守節儉原則。</p><p></p><p>消委會總幹事同意署方建議。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T08:03:57.711965+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":588,"images":7,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T06:21:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T22:09:35.922819+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T07:57:17.594384+00:00","content_hash":"5973905fb50409560d72ae6293b2954da742c4cd3963b62a76ede03770aa890e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T08:03:57.711965+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}